    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12407453/comment/12643628",
          "id": "12643628",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=reschke",
            "name": "reschke",
            "key": "reschke",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677"
            },
            "displayName": "Julian Reschke",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "Why would that be a \"misbehaving\" editor???\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=reschke",
            "name": "reschke",
            "key": "reschke",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677"
            },
            "displayName": "Julian Reschke",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "created": "2008-10-29T19:54:22.237+0000",
          "updated": "2008-10-29T19:54:22.237+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12407453/comment/12643635",
          "id": "12643635",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=gjoseph",
            "name": "gjoseph",
            "key": "gjoseph",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Gr\u00e9gory Joseph",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "Because it makes Jackrabbit unhappy ;)\n\nMore seriously, simply because it modified the file - most likely - without informing the user. If some software modifies the format of a file it edits into what is essentially a different format, one could qualify that as misbehavior. That's sort out of the scope of this issue, though ;)",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=gjoseph",
            "name": "gjoseph",
            "key": "gjoseph",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Gr\u00e9gory Joseph",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "created": "2008-10-29T20:04:59.514+0000",
          "updated": "2008-10-29T20:04:59.514+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12407453/comment/12643637",
          "id": "12643637",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=reschke",
            "name": "reschke",
            "key": "reschke",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677"
            },
            "displayName": "Julian Reschke",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "Yep. I just wanted to clarify that a UTF-8 BOM is totally legal in an XML file.\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=reschke",
            "name": "reschke",
            "key": "reschke",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=reschke&avatarId=52677"
            },
            "displayName": "Julian Reschke",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "created": "2008-10-29T20:10:33.285+0000",
          "updated": "2008-10-29T20:10:33.285+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12407453/comment/12643639",
          "id": "12643639",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=gjoseph",
            "name": "gjoseph",
            "key": "gjoseph",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Gr\u00e9gory Joseph",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "It is, and unfortunately, as it stands, Jackrabbit won't support it.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=gjoseph",
            "name": "gjoseph",
            "key": "gjoseph",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
